      <Desc>EMPOWER LANGUAGE ACADEMY IS A PUBLIC CHARTER SCHOOL IN SAN DIEGO, CALIFORNIA. THE EDUCATIONAL PHILOSOPHY IS BASED ON THE BELIEF THAT WHEN THE SCHOOL, PARENTS, AND COMMUNITY WORK TOGETHER TO EMPOWER A CHILD USING A HOLISTIC APPROACH, THE CHILD WILL BE EQUIPPED TO ACHIEVE HIS/ HER EDUCATIONAL GOALS AND BECOME A CONTRIBUTING MEMBER OF SOCIETY. EMPOWER LANGUAGE ACADEMY BELIEVES THAT IN ORDER TO PREPARE STUDENTS TO BE GLOBAL LEADERS, BILINGUALISM AND BI-LITERACY IN A FOREIGN LANGUAGE IS AN ESSENTIAL LIFE SKILL. EMPOWER LANGUAGE ACADEMY ALSO BELIEVES THAT PERSONAL WELLNESS IS AN IMPORTANT COMPONENT TO A SUCCESSFUL LIFE.</Desc>
